  "system": {
    "description": "<p>Choose one enemy target within 30ft. They make a Fate Check against your Check DC. If they fail, they take XD4 damage, where X is the difference between their roll and your Check DC (i.e., if your Check DC is 20 and they roll a 16 Fate Check, they take 4D4 damage). Once a target has made a Fate Check against Runic Scars, you cannot target them again until a Quick Rest has passed.</p>",
